msgctxt "56_Worker Kawasaki"
msgid "Something isn't right with that manhole."
msgstr "Algo anda mal con esa alcantarilla."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Worker Omori"
msgid "I know, it's creeping me out. I keep hearing noises\\r\ncoming from beyond the blocked-off area."
msgstr "Lo sé, da miedo. Sigo escuchando sonidos\\r\nque vienen desde el área bloqueada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Worker Kawasaki"
msgid "Yeah, me too. And if I didn't know any better, I'd swear\\r\nI saw footprints leading in and out of the darn thing."
msgstr "Yo igual. Además, juraría que vi huellas\\r\nque van y vienen de la cosa esa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Worker Omori"
msgid "Oh, they're real. But I took a closer look, and get this:\\r\nthey're not work boots like ours, they're dress shoes."
msgstr "Oh, son reales. Las miré más de cerca, y escucha esto:\\r\nNo son de botas de trabajo como las nuestras, son de zapatos de vestir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=3
msgctxt "104_Saejima"
msgid "(What're dressed-up folks doing crawlin' down a manhole?)"
msgstr "(¿Qué hace gente de traje arrastrándose por una alcantarilla?)."
